{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17644","headline":"梁国惠康公主挽歌词二首 一 · 羊士谔","name":"梁国惠康公主挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汤沐成陈迹，山林遂寂寥。\n鹊飞应织素，凤起独吹箫。\n玉殿中参罢，云軿上汉遥。\n皇情非不极，空辍未央朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}